  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「どこへ隠れたの～？　もう探さないよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ねぇ、まさか『かくれんぼ』の途中でどこかに行っちゃうとか、眠りこけちゃってるとかしてないよね、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしひとりで空回ってるわけじゃないよね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あんずお姉ちゃんが『もうすぐお昼ごはんだから、出てきなさい』って言ってるよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「お～い、聞こえてる？　返事してよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「まったく、どこ行っちゃったんだろうね、君は？　いつも静かにしてるから、こういうとき困っちゃうな」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「もし、このまま出てきてくれなかったら、置いて帰っちゃうことになるよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「せっかく遠くまで、旅行に来てるのに？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ええと、どこにいるんだろう……ひまわりの背が高いから、探すのにもひと苦労だよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ここかな。それとも、別のところ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「う～ん、見つからない。こんなとき、携帯電話とかあればなぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「電話してすぐに場所がわかっちゃうのに。子供だからって持たせてもらえなかったんだよね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「しかたない。地道に探すかな……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ええと、彼が最初の『かくれんぼ』で隠れてたのが、あのあたりだから……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「もうすこし、遠くのほうまで行ってるかも。男の子って、けっこう体力あるものね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「徒競走のときも、わたしよりも足が速かったみたいだし？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「なんて、わたしが『どんくさい』だけかな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしが『鬼ごっこ』なんてしたら、すぐに鬼にされちゃうもん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「だから『かくれんぼ』にしようって提案したのに。逆に、探すのに時間がかかっちゃってるなあ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「せっかく考えたのに、裏目に出ちゃったみたい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「これなら『おままごと』とか、そういう遊びのほうがよかったかも？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ごっこ遊びとはいえ、夫婦でいられるし～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あなた、今日も遅かったのね。いつもお仕事ごくろうさま……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「晩ごはん、先に食べてていいって言われたけど、さみしくて……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あなたが帰ってくるまで、待ってたんだよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「食卓にひとりぼっちだと、悲しいよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ねぇねぇ、隣に座って、食べていいかな……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「な～んて。ちょっとのろけちゃったりもして♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
