    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「って、うわっ!?　うしろにいたんだ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「は、恥ずかしい～っ！　もしかして今の聞いてた？　聞こえちゃってたよね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ねぇ、黙ってないで答えてよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「もう。いるならいるって、ちゃんと言ってよ。けっこう心配したんだよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「たしかに、隠れたひとを見つけ出す遊びだから、急に出てこられても困るといえば困るけどね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「う～ん、変なところで気をつかうんだから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「というか、あんずお姉ちゃんがわたしたちのことを呼んでたの、聞こえなかった？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「へ？　わたしの名前の由来がふと気になって、それですっかり聞こえてなかったの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「それでそのまま、ひまわりの陰に隠れて、考えごとを、してたんだ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「変なときに興味を持つんだね、君って……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-s-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-child_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 442
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「うん。わたしはなつみ。夏に生まれたから、『なつみ』って名付けられたんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ストレートな付け方で、なんのひねりもないかもしれないけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「気に入ってるんだよね。この名前のこと」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「だって、夏に祝福されてる気がするから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「寒い冬が来て、植物さんたちが土の中にもぐっちゃったとしても、また、春が来て、夏になれば……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「このひまわりみたいに、太陽に向かってまっすぐ、上を向いていられるから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「だから、大好きなんだ。夏が、この名前が」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
